  "visibleText": "练习\nListening Part 1\nListening Part 2\nListening Part 3\nListening Part 4\nListening Part 1 货物运输\n0% · 0 / 2 完成\n\nChoose the correct letter, A, B or C.\n\nQuestions 9–10\n\nA customer is arranging to send a large box overseas.\n\nType of insurance chosen\n\nA Economy\nB Standard\nC Premium\n作答 1\n暂时不会\n\nCustomer wants goods delivered to\n\nA port\nB home\nC depot\n作答 2\n暂时不会\n答案\n\n选材来源 · Cambridge · Listening sample task · Multiple choice · Questions 9–10 · 在线来源\n\nListening Part 2 社区活动\n0% · 0 / 6 完成\n\nWrite NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER for each answer.\n\nQuestions 11–16\n\nYou will hear an extract from a talk given to a group who are going to stay in the UK.\n\nWhat TWO factors can make social contact in a foreign country difficult? — First answer\n\n作答 1\n暂时不会\n\nWhat TWO factors can make social contact in a foreign country difficult? — Second answer\n\n作答 2\n暂时不会\n\nWhich types of community group does the speaker give examples of? — theatre; ______; ______ (first blank)\n\n作答 3\n暂时不会\n\nWhich types of community group does the speaker give examples of? — theatre; ______; ______ (second blank)\n\n作答 4\n暂时不会\n\nIn which TWO places can information about community activities be found? — First answer\n\n作答 5\n暂时不会\n\nIn which TWO places can information about community activities be found? — Second answer\n\n作答 6\n暂时不会\n答案\n\n选材来源 · Cambridge · Listening sample task · Short-answer questions · Questions 11–16 · 在线来源\n\nListening Part 3 远程学习\n0% · 0 / 4 完成\n\nWrite NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS for each answer.\n\nQuestions 27–30\n\nRachel and Paul are discussing studying with the Open University.\n\nStudying with the Open University demanded a great deal of ______.\n\n作答 1\n暂时不会\n\nStudying and working at the same time improved Rachel’s ______ skills.\n\n作答 2\n暂时不会\n\nIt was helpful that the course was structured in ______.\n\n作答 3\n暂时不会\n\nShe enjoyed meeting other students at ______.\n\n作答 4\n暂时不会\n答案\n\n选材来源 · Cambridge · Listening sample task · Sentence completion · Questions 27–30 · 在线来源\n\nListening Part 4 学习研究\n0% · 0 / 5 完成\n\n播放整卷原音中的 Part 4，完成第 33–37 题。Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer.\n\nResearch findings · Questions 33–37\n\nComplete the research findings below.\n\nFirst level of importance · Personal Characteristics: Enjoyment of a ______\n\n作答 1\n暂时不会\n\nSecond level of importance · Social and Environmental Factors: Positive experiences at ______\n\n作答 2\n暂时不会\n\nSecond level of importance · Other Factors: Good ______\n\n作答 3\n暂时不会\n\nSecond level of importance · Personal Characteristics: Many ______ in daily life\n\n作答 4\n暂时不会\n\nThird level of importance · Social and Environmental Factors: Good interaction with the ______\n\n作答 5\n暂时不会\n答案\n\n选材来源 · IELTS · Learner Persistence · Questions 33–37 · 在线来源",
